  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984270000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Karen. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984278266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Karen, I need to return an item I bought last month. It's a VeloBand Cadence Sensor.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66708,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984282866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Certainly, I can help you with that. Can I just get your name and order number to pull up your account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984288866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. The name is Arthur Pendelton, and the order was VF-881-925.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66708,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984295933332
    },
    {
      "text": "One moment, Mr. Pendelton... Okay, I have your account right here. Thank you for being a VeloFit VIP member, we really appreciate your loyalty.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984300799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks. So, can I return this band?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66708,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984310533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. I see here you received it on December 15th, and our policy allows returns for up to 90 days, so it's no problem at all.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984313066664
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, that's great news. I wasn't sure what the window was.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66708,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984322399997
    },
    {
      "text": "Not to worry! I've gone ahead and authorized the return for you. I'm emailing the pre-paid return label to you right now. Just print it out and drop the package off.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984326399997
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect, that's so easy.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66708,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984337599997
    },
    {
      "text": "And just as a small thank you for being a VIP, I've also added a $25 credit to your account for your next purchase. Will there be anything else for you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984339399997
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, thank you so much! That's very kind of you. No, that's all I needed.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66708,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767984350133330
    },
    {
